        <title>start</title>
        <link>https://www.resolutionbazaar.com/doku.php?id=agentic_framework:resolution_pillars:start&amp;rev=1744456961&amp;do=diff</link>
        <description>Agentic Framework

01_generative_chatbot 

 STAKEHOLDER CHATBOT - Generative chatbots serve as a communication platform where stakeholders can seek answers to their queries regarding the insolvency process. These chatbots provide instant responses, helping to manage stakeholder expectations and reduce the workload of IPs by addressing routine inquiries.</description>
